Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.18,0:00:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,ODIN Pocket: a language model built from its first weight.\NGIBC V2 — Track 01: Foundational LLM Development.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.20,0:00:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,49,295,872 trainable parameters, including embeddings and output.\NThe whole model fits below the 50 million parameter limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This continuation is generated by our local checkpoint on CPU.\NThere is no inference API, retrieval substitute, or scripted answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a base language model: give it a beginning, not an instruction.\NIts generated text can be repetitive or factually wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:01:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The tokens below come from that exact generation.\NSelect one to inspect the probability before sampling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.86,0:01:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The second tool compares possible endings using causal log likelihood.\NBoth candidates are scored by the same model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We normalize by candidate token count. Higher means more likely,\Nnot more truthful: this preference is not a fact check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Training hardware: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070.\N983,040,000 tokens processed in 3.92 recorded hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.01,0:01:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The development loss curve comes directly from the training log.\NThe page shows only evidence tied to the loaded training run.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.04,0:02:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,These are full, zero-shot evaluations through lm-evaluation-harness:\NHellaSwag, ARC-Easy, PIQA and WinoGrande.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.05,0:02:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,WikiText-103 measures held-out language modeling.\NToken perplexity depends on the tokenizer; the full protocol is documented.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.13,0:02:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Weights start randomly. Training uses public FineWeb-Edu and WikiText text.\NNo pretrained weights, private teacher targets, or distillation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.13,0:02:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Checkpoint identity, source code, training recipe and measured results\Nmake the experiment reproducible. Development was assisted by OpenAI Codex.
